**constructive,** in legal & quasi-legal use, is applied to an act that, while it does not answer to the statutory or formal definition of the offence &c. under which (qualified by *c.*) it is classed (*c. treason, rebellion, blasphemy, obligation, &c.*), is seen, when the true construction
