**content(s),** what is contained. The OED says 'The stress *conte'nt* is historical, & still common among the educated'.
>>>

<<<
The -stress co’nient is due partly to Noun & ADJECTIVE ACCENT & partly to the wish to differentiate from content = contentment. But contents is still almost always accented on the last, & that
===
The stress *co'ntent* is due partly to ^^NOUN & ADJECTIVE ACCENT^^ & partly to the wish to differentiate from *content* = *contentment.* But *contents* is still almost always accented on the last, & that
>>>
